  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Cracked Beaks, or 'Crackers' as he's known in Subchain City, isn't just another bone-dry quacker. He clawed his way up from the ruins of Pedro's Watching, scavenging for scraps and dealing in data. He witnessed the collapse of the old web, and now, he's determined to protect the little DRIP that's left.",
